OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a 
OL,6,Fdry evening and night with mostly      
OL,7,Fclear skies. Frost will become         
OL,8,Fwidespread inland and in the east,     
OL,9,Fless cold but breezy over southwestern 
OL,10,Fcoasts.                                
OL,12,CMonday:FAnother dry day with some long 
OL,13,Fsunny spells for most though the far   
OL,14,Fwest will turn cloudier later. Cold    
OL,15,Fwith some frost early and late.        
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain  
OL,18,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on 
OL,19,Fhills for a time. Rain dying out on    
OL,20,FWednesday then mainly dry on Thursday. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
